{
  "_comment": [
    "Every NEW Milestone 7 sound event (docs/MILESTONE_7.md 11). Owned by the lead; workers request changes.",
    "Existing, reused sounds are not listed and keep their audio: workbench.slot, workbench.assemble, saber.ignite, blaster.fire and the rest.",
    "feature: the recipe module tools/assets/sounds/<feature>.py whose FILES entry renders this id (every M7 module is SD's). Until that entry",
    "exists, gen_sounds.py renders a labelled placeholder into <group>/<name>[1..variants] (see gen_sounds.py --m7 --placeholders).",
    "loop: every file is rendered as a seamless loop. stream: written into sounds.json as \"stream\": true. volume goes into sounds.json when",
    "it is not 1.0. variants: the number of placeholder files (default 1).",
    "Run python3 tools/assets/gen_sounds.py --m7 --java after editing, then commit the audio, sounds.json, lang part and ModSounds.",
    "tools/check_m7_ids.py checks every id here has its sounds.json entry and audio."
  ],
